              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi lapho uJehova ebavusela abahluleli, uJehova wayenaye umahluleli, wabasindisa esandleni sezitha zabo zonke izinsuku zomahluleli; ngokuba uJehova wazisola kubo, wakhala ngenxa yalabo ababebacindezela. Futhi wabacasula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.18",
