              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi lapho esefile umahluleli, babuya futhi bonakalisa bona ngaphezu kwawoyise ngokulandela abanye onkulunkulu ukuba babakhonze futhi babakhothamele; abazange bayeke izenzo zabo kanye nezindlela zabo ezilukhuni.",
