              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi kusukela manje kuqhubeke ngeke ngixoshe muntu phambi kwabo ezizweni uJoshuwa azishiya lapho efa.",
          "type": "text",
